3A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <em>not</em> a subspace because it's not closed under scalar multiplication.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I and IV only.\" </p>\n</div>",
